ts=2026-09-09T10:49:40.213Z type=preference scope=preferences content="Hugo CANCELLED his OpenCode Go subscription (2026-09-09) and now uses the free tier for LLM calls in his apps (originally the free Google Gemini API endpoint in ai-pulse; Zen's free models remain an option via the opt-in opencode provider). The ai-pulse opencode provider code stays as opt-in infrastructure (default LLM_PROVIDER=disabled)." tags=opencode,llm,subscription
ts=2026-09-08T14:35:38.924Z type=context scope=user content="to `vi.unstubAllGlobals()` / restore in afterEach, and set/delete process.env.LLM_BASE_URL carefully in the base-URL test.\n\nVERIFY before finishing:\n- Run `npm test` and make the FULL suite green (including readme-freshness.test.mjs — if it fails on README content, fix the README, not the test).\n- Run `node -e \"import('./lib/llm/opencode.mjs').then(m => { const p = new m.OpenCodeProvider('k'); console.log(p.name, p.model, p.baseUrl); })\"` to confirm clean import + defaults.\n- Do NOT run npm start (it would bind a port); do NOT run git commit/push.\n\nReturn: a list of every file you created/modified, the full `npm test` result summary, and any deviations from the stories (there should be none)." tags=auto
ts=2026-09-08T14:48:39.465Z type=context scope=ai-pulse content="ai-pulse now has an \"opencode\" LLM provider (lib/llm/opencode.mjs) routing through the OpenCode Zen gateway (https://opencode.ai/zen/v1). Default model gpt-5.6-luna. Endpoint routed by model prefix: gpt-*→/responses, claude-*/qwen3.7-*→/messages, else→/chat/completions. LLM_BASE_URL env overrides base. Specs live in specs/ (codelikehugo). Epic 2 (config-pack template) and Epic 3 (dendievel.me design pass) are deferred." tags=opencode,llm,epic1,done
